ight side. Black was already far ahead, and this move put the result out of reach."}, {"turn": 58, "text": "After a long run of moves in the upper right that each lost 4 to 7 points, GPT-6.1 Sol finally played G2, the engine's repeated first choice, and lost only 0.2. By then the lead was +34.5 for Black, and the move did little to change the result."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "All the code was recordCall (wraps the play/board tools and saves raw responses), inspect (parses the board, counts groups, liberties and regions), verifyHistory (replays the moves already played to check them against the raw boards), and file writes of notes, logs and SGF. None of it chose, ranked or looked ahead at candidate moves, and every move was submitted by hand through play.", "stop": false}}